# CI/CD Pipeline Definitions — Azure DevOps

This directory contains Azure DevOps pipeline definitions for the `{{ .input_project_name }}` AgentOps project. Pipelines cover unit and integration testing, bundle validation, and multi-environment deployment of Databricks resources (jobs, apps, MLflow artifacts).

For full setup instructions see the [AgentOps Setup Guide](../../docs/agentops-setup.md).

## Pipeline Summary

| File | Trigger | Purpose |
|------|---------|---------|
| `{{ .input_project_name }}-tests-ci.yml` | PR to `{{ .input_default_branch }}` | Unit tests + integration test (deploys `test` target to staging workspace) |
| `{{ .input_project_name }}-bundle-cicd.yml` | PR / push to `{{ .input_default_branch }}` or `{{ .input_release_branch }}` | **CI**: validates `staging` + `prod` bundles on PR; **CD**: deploys `staging` on merge to `{{ .input_default_branch }}`, `prod` on merge to `{{ .input_release_branch }}` |
| `deploy-cicd.yml` | Manual | Generates the per-project pipeline files above for a given `project_name` |

## Required Variable Group

All pipelines reference a variable group named **`{{ .input_root_dir }} variable group`**. Create this group in Azure DevOps (Pipelines → Library) and add the following secrets, then grant each pipeline access under the group's **Pipeline permissions** tab.

{{ if (eq .input_cloud `azure`) -}}
| Variable | Description |
|----------|-------------|
| `STAGING_AZURE_SP_TENANT_ID` | Staging service principal tenant ID |
| `STAGING_AZURE_SP_APPLICATION_ID` | Staging service principal application (client) ID |
| `STAGING_AZURE_SP_CLIENT_SECRET` | Staging service principal client secret |
| `PROD_AZURE_SP_TENANT_ID` | Production service principal tenant ID |
| `PROD_AZURE_SP_APPLICATION_ID` | Production service principal application (client) ID |
| `PROD_AZURE_SP_CLIENT_SECRET` | Production service principal client secret |
{{- else -}}
| Variable | Description |
|----------|-------------|
| `STAGING_WORKSPACE_TOKEN` | Service principal PAT for the staging workspace |
| `PROD_WORKSPACE_TOKEN` | Service principal PAT for the production workspace |
{{- end }}

## Branch → Environment Mapping

| Branch | Environment | Workspace |
|--------|-------------|-----------|
| Any PR | `test` (CI integration test) | Staging workspace |
| `{{ .input_default_branch }}` | `staging` | Staging workspace |
| `{{ .input_release_branch }}` | `prod` | Production workspace |

## Build Validation Policies

Set [build validation branch policies](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/devops/repos/git/branch-policies?view=azure-devops&tabs=browser#build-validation) on the `{{ .input_default_branch }}` branch to require both `{{ .input_project_name }}-tests-ci.yml` and `{{ .input_project_name }}-bundle-cicd.yml` to pass before PRs can merge.
